## 2. Fonts & Typography (utilities)

Fonts used:

- Body: `font-sans` (defined in code via Next/font + `--font-inter`)
- Display: via the `font-display` utility
  - The `font-display` utility is defined in `app/globals.css` and uses `--font-geist`

Reminder: in practice, follow the typography hierarchy described in section 8.

---

## 2b. Controls (Button / Input / Select / Tabs)

Dense controls inspired by Resend. Change the shared UI components, not page-level classes.

| Token | Value |
|---|---|
| Height | `h-8` (default). Landing / marketing CTAs may use `size="lg"` (`h-10`) |
| Radius | `rounded-xl` |
| Padding | `px-3` ; with leading icon prefer `pl-2.5` ; select chevron `pr-2.5` |
| Gap icon/label | `gap-1` |
| Type | `text-sm` ; primary CTA `font-semibold` ; select trigger `font-normal` |
| Focus | `ring-2` + `ring-ring` |

Variants (Button):
- `default` : primary CTA (border + `font-semibold`)
- `outline` : secondary / filter / combobox trigger
- `ghost` / `secondary` / `link` : unchanged roles
- Tabs : no muted track ; triggers are `h-8 rounded-xl` pills, active = `bg-accent`

Files: `components/ui/button.tsx`, `input.tsx`, `select.tsx`, `tabs.tsx`, `input-group.tsx`, `search-select.tsx`.

